397 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 398 0 R/Alt(Two panels sharing 27 rows, grouped by candidate: the family inverse on T1, T2, T3 and T5 at three tiers, the level ladder on 2 s rungs on T1 and T5, the level ladder on whole-sweep rungs on T1 and T5, and the dither identification on T4. Panel (a) plots completions from 0 to 6: the family inverse sits at 0 where matrix sits at 6 on the linear rows, and a little above matrix on the strong T2 and T3 rows. The level ladder on 2 s rungs nearly matches matrix on T1 and is below it on T5 realistic. The level ladder on whole-sweep rungs completes 3 of 6 on linear and none elsewhere. The dither identification and matrix both complete 6 of 6 on every dwell row. Panel (b) plots paired median over-test differences: the family inverse from about +13 to +22 dB on linear rows and up to +13 dB on realistic rows; the level ladder near zero; the dither identification just above zero on all three rows.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 1207 0 R>>
endobj
