533 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 534 0 R/Alt(Three panels. (a) Bars of nonlinear sweeps completed out of 36: matrix 9, followed poles 16, pole trajectory 12, amplitude-indexed poles 12, placed poles 18, preview control 15, preview on a frozen model 6. (b) Paired bars per variant of the tests and tiers meeting the rule: against matrix, pole trajectory 3, amplitude-indexed poles 1, placed poles 3, preview control 2, preview on a frozen model 0; against followed poles only placed poles has one. (c) Markers for each variant at six nonlinear tests and tiers, p95 difference from followed poles in dB: pole trajectory, amplitude-indexed poles, placed poles and preview control cluster within about 1.3 dB of zero, mostly above it, placed poles below zero on T2 strong; preview on a frozen model lies 1 to 9 dB above.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[2]/Pg 1212 0 R>>
endobj
