<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 608 0 R/Alt(Two panels. (a) Three stacked horizontal bars of 380 runs. matrix: 160 completed, a few stopped on lower rungs, 203 at full level, 10 held. paired: none completed, 185 stopped at -12 dB, 75 on the middle rungs, 110 at full level, 10 held. ratio: 4 completed, a few on lower rungs, 350 at full level, 10 held. (b) A strip chart per system (3 x 12, 6 x 12, 12 x 24, 6 x 6, 12 x 12): each dot a structure's share in percent, from about 3 to 72 percent, mostly clustered near or below the bar for one over the number of shakers: 33, 17, 8, 17 and 8 percent.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 1215 0 R>>
