<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 658 0 R/Alt(Two panels. (a) Seven fit methods on the horizontal axis (M0, M3, M5, M7, M7c, M7d, M9d), four markers each for the frame sets. Modes found rise from about 20 percent for M0 to 72 to 84 percent for M7d and M9d, all below the 95 percent bar. Modes within 10 percent rise from 2 to 7 percent for M0 to 54 to 76 percent for M9d, below the 90 percent bar; M3, M5 and M7 put none of the realistic frames' modes within 10 percent. (b) Bars of relative in-band model error: with the block's delay or the estimated delay about 0.09 and 0.14; with no delay removed 0.50 and 0.70; with the engine lag less the pipeline 0.56 and 0.78.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[13]/Pg 1217 0 R>>
